flowchart LR
    Admin[Administrator] -->|settings and status| UI[Mantine Registry cache tab]
    UI -->|authorized management API| Controller[Single Go controller process]
    Guest[Enrolled workspace VM] -->|original reference via Docker and embedded BuildKit| OCI[Guest HTTPS OCI handler]
    OCI -->|current VM identity and ns dispatch| Controller
    Controller --> Guard[Public destination transport]
    Guard -->|anonymous OCI reads only| Registry[Public registries and token services]
    Controller --> Admission[Reservations and LRU leases]
    Admission --> CAS[Shared digest content and isolated repository links]
    Admission --> Volume[Physical volume safety guard]
    Controller -->|no retention when capacity refused| Stream[Bounded memory streaming]
    Stream --> OCI
    Controller --> State[Settings and workspace freshness]
    State --> UI
    Guest -.->|direct fallback only if existing egress allows| Registry
